	<Replace Tag="LOC_UNIT_MILITARY_ENGINEER_ALT_DESCRIPTION" Language="zh_Hans_CN">
      <Text>中世纪支援单位。需要“兵工厂”才能生产。[NEWLINE][NEWLINE]与军事工程师相邻的友方近战和抗骑兵单位可对所有等级的城墙造成全额伤害。[NEWLINE][NEWLINE]能建造道路、铁路、堡垒、飞机跑道、导弹发射井和穿山隧道改良设施。其建造次数可用于加快水渠、运河、堤坝、社区和城墙的建造进度。</Text>
    </Replace>
	<Replace Tag="LOC_UNIT_MILITARY_ENGINEER_ALT_DESCRIPTION" Language="en_US">
      <Text>Medieval era support unit. Requires an Armory to produce. [NEWLINE][NEWLINE]Adjacent friendly melee and anti-cavalry units do full damage to city defenses.[NEWLINE][NEWLINE]Can construct Roads, Railroads, Forts, Airstrips, Missile Silos, and Mountain Tunnel improvements. One of their build charges can also be used to boost the construction of a Aqueduct, Canal, Dam, and Neighborhoods district and city Walls.</Text>
    </Replace>
